D8A7  C9                                RET
                                
D8A8                            RESTORE:
D8A8  2A 1E D0                          LD HL,(B_DS)
D8AB  22 20 D0                          LD (EADS),HL
D8AE  2A 1C D0                          LD HL,(B_SS)
D8B1  22 22 D0                          LD (EASS),HL
D8B4  DD 21 3B D8                       LD IX,NEXT
